# API Conventions

- Use `@rebind/db` for Prisma, `@rebind/shared` for types and PLANS
- Return errors as `{ error: { code, message } }` with correct HTTP status
- Validate request bodies with Zod
- Auth middleware on all `/binders` and `/cards` routes
- Never expose `password_hash` or Stripe secrets in responses
- Use `request.log` / `app.log` with structured `event` fields — never `console.log`
- See `apps/api/src/lib/logger.ts` and [docs/LOGGING.md](../../docs/LOGGING.md)
